  m_text: "Step 1  Heat oil in a pot over medium heat. saut\xE9 garlic and black
    peppercorns until garlic is brown and fragrant.\n\nStep 2  Add pork belly and
    saut\xE9 until the meat is browned.\n\nStep 3 Add vinegar, soy sauce, and water.
